          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(comp (ref \"R7\") (value \"5.1M\")"
        },
        {
          "source": "spice",
          "quote": "R7 0 Net-_J12-CC2_ 5.1Meg"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The USB-C port may fail to present a valid Rd on CC2, so depending on cable orientation the host may not provide VBUS, causing loss or intermittency of USB-powered logic/programming.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The netlist and SPICE deck otherwise match the specified power, SPI, thermocouple, heater, and fan architecture; the clear deviation is R7 being 5.1 MΩ instead of the specified 5.1 kΩ USB-C CC pull-down."
}

